{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0433_1001_033sih", "source_sha256": "74f7d78a55918286452ee8cf3264918dab1ed520f4c651c8ec88824dba923012", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです。\n先ほどの撮影、どうでしたか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n刚才的拍摄，感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
