{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0433_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "c29aa5f5f3c2e577ecf0290f8edcdaab2cd2984a2b7ccd6bada355d8eed7ec11", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\n事前に予習をしていた甲斐がありましたね。", "zh": "谢谢。看来提前预习是值得的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0433_1004_p", "source_sha256": "5166f3726ba63f90a0212f9c1fa5307e0de78e4f2a8045b6d59f926af381839a", "ja": "予習？", "zh": "预习？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0433_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "2f49e13862b7eec59c8f8f553a7dc463c8a4ef4b2af43e6fbed24541b6eaa8ef", "ja": "はい。イメージを固められたらと思って、\nいくつかスパイ映画を見てみたんです。", "zh": "是的。我想着要是能明确一下形象就好了，所以看了几部间谍电影。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0433_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "1872cab74ed0401bbe5131f34ff98a8bbd4f094c927cbcdd00075969de567abc", "ja": "それで……ひとつ聞いてもいいですか？\n少し引っ掛かってる部分があって。", "zh": "所以……我可以问一个问题吗？\n有个地方让我有点在意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0433_1007_p", "source_sha256": "074e68f33ecbf860e3b103f91c969389ebe3e9e1f14944d276b64938fd9d5bce", "ja": "おっ、いいぞ。なんでも聞いてくれ！", "zh": "哦，没问题。想问什么都行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0433_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "9d02cd6b865956978f85abaea5012c96fc013c76040a7351a5e3499340c094dc", "ja": "スパイがいくらセクシーだからって、現実に……\nあんなに簡単に騙せてしまうものなんでしょうか？", "zh": "间谍再怎么性感，在现实中……\n也能那么轻易地把人骗到吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0433_1009_p", "source_sha256": "234a16bd38487cb4194e537ec4d3a45b03b17a82083a10366a0d40d9b3486247", "ja": "うーん……情報を得る手段に、色仕掛けがあるだけで、\n騙される要因はセクシーだけじゃないんじゃないかな。", "zh": "嗯……色诱只是获取情报的手段之一，会被骗的原因应该不只是性感吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0433_1010_033sih", "source_sha256": "f160d83503a28643193d68d8e5ef44aa009bca72395a1edc23ef770203cf7fe3", "ja": "なるほど……。見た目や仕草で気を引くのは、\nあくまで技術のひとつということですね。", "zh": "原来如此……。通过外表和举止吸引对方的注意，\n归根结底也只是手段之一。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0433_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "0d043fc64a73f4365b716874ee4042b363e5b17073da95d12f758c48ca1eef43", "ja": "でもそうよね、それならあのシーンも……。\nありがとうございます。なんとなく掴めた気がします。", "zh": "不过确实是这样呢，这么说来，那个场景也是……  \n谢谢你。我好像有点明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0433_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ab0688e9763f75625a33ca4945a8bd1573107e68670d05607611058e7d7b96aa", "ja": "それなら良かった！　でも志保みたいに綺麗な子が\n本物のスパイだったら、俺も騙されてしまうかもな！", "zh": "那就好！不过要是像志保那么漂亮的女孩真的是间谍，我可能也会被她骗到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0433_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "c2d8fd78359f63468ef7de46f84dd0da350c67a29faa5501c11908b8d3e3adb7", "ja": "…………。あの、{$P$}さん。\n本当に気を付けてくださいね？", "zh": "…………那个，{$P$}先生。\n请您真的多加小心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0433_1014_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0433_1015_033sih", "source_sha256": "abf40b8ce51c49005cf35c51ff85e0d98805028564c371d7f52573416a44613a", "ja": "いえ、なんでもありません。それじゃ、行ってきます。\nこの後の撮影も期待しててください。", "zh": "不，没什么。那么，我先走了。\n也请期待接下来的拍摄。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0433_1016_p", "source_sha256": "7db75325c6aa89a49c2bd5a66d45027eaec160e1483046071395b2f656b6c642", "ja": "（その後の撮影もスムーズに進み、いい写真が撮れた！\nそれにしても……なんで志保に心配されたんだろう？）", "zh": "（之后的拍摄也进行得很顺利，拍到了很棒的照片！不过话说回来……志保为什么会担心我呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
